{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HOPE \u2013 Realistic Large-Scale War Simulation FPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Physics-Based Gunfights</strong><br>Experience gunplay grounded in <strong>real-world ballistics</strong>.<br>Bullets follow physical trajectories influenced by gravity and speed.<br>This isn\u2019t simple crosshair aiming \u2014 <strong>every shot requires real calculation</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc65 <strong>Hundreds of AI Soldiers Fill the Battlefield</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd2b <strong>A Variety of Weapons and Combat Gear</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assault rifles, sniper rifles, RPGs, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from different body armor and helmets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each weapon feels distinct with unique recoil and behavior</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udccc <strong>Please Note:</strong><br>\ud83d\udca5 This is <strong>not a strategy or command-based game</strong>.<br>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <i>Steam Workshop support is currently on hold.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3591890?t=1746165062","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591890/555c2ccb52ee29c4e91823c284a26ceb91083b2a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746165062","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591890/4fb904607dd84b1d33f03d841b32f293485a3b1b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746165062","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591890/4fb904607dd84b1d33f03d841b32f293485a3b1b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746165062","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HOPE \